# ============================================================================
# ORACLE OS — .gitignore
#
# Tujuan: artefak build TIDAK boleh masuk Git.
# Image Debian Live + folder kerja `live-build` bisa berukuran puluhan GB;
# sekali ter-commit, repo membengkak permanen dan push ke GitHub ditolak.
#
# Aturan: yang di-commit hanya sumber (config, dokumentasi, skrip, definisi
# paket & profile). Semua hasil build diabaikan.
# ============================================================================

# ---- Hasil build image -----------------------------------------------------
/out/
/build/
*.iso
*.img
*.iso.sha256
*.iso.sig
*.iso.zsync
*.torrent

# ---- Folder kerja live-build ----------------------------------------------
# Muncul kalau `lb build` dijalankan. Kalau build dijalankan dari root proyek,
# folder bernama `config/`, `binary/`, `chroot/`, `cache/`, `local/`, `.build/`
# akan dibuat di sini. `config/` milik proyek TIDAK diabaikan — karena itu
# build sebaiknya dijalankan di workspace terpisah (mis. build/), bukan di root.
/binary/
/chroot/
/cache/
/local/
/.build/
/.stage/
/build.log
binary.log
chroot.log
*.build.log
*.bootstrap.log

# ---- Media virtual / pengujian -------------------------------------------
*.qcow2
*.vdi
*.vmdk
*.vhd
/out/*.qcow2
*.pid
*.monitor

# ---- Cache paket & tool ---------------------------------------------------
apt-cache/
*.deb
!dists/**/*.deb
debian-live/

# ---- Rahasia / kredensial -------------------------------------------------
# Jangan pernah commit kunci signing paket, token, atau kredensial.
*.key
*.gpg
*.asc
!docs/**/*.asc
.env
.env.*
*.secret
secrets/

# ---- Editor & OS ----------------------------------------------------------
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.*.swp
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ---- Python ---------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/

# ---- Catatan lokal --------------------------------------------------------
notes.local.md
*.local.conf